          "answer": "kelima",
          "discussion": "Panel kedua menyebut 5 Padi dan kapas.",
          "image": {
            "src": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/daniyasa-pixel/eduyasa/main/kelas-3/pkn/assets/pkn-b04-gambar-02.svg",
